comment0.text=\r\n\ Represents\ a\ game\ in\ the\ game\ library.\r\n\ Stores\ basic\ information\ such\ as\ title,\ genre,\ age\ rating,\r\n\ platform,\ user\ rating,\ and\ play\ status.\r\n\r\n\ @author\ Sarah,\ Anuj\r\n\ @version\ 1.0\r\n
